    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a chilling adventure through a mysterious forest on a cold Christmas Eve night, searching for ornaments to decorate a Christmas tree. But beware\u2014something lurks in the\u00a0 snowy darkness\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics, viewed through the lens of a retro home video camera, create an immersive and chilling experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short, Christmas-themed horror game I created for the holiday season. I hope you find it both festive and fun! It\u2019s built using the same framework as my other game, <i>Backrooms: The Project</i>. This will help speed up development for that title and help me optimize it for the Steam Deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun, and don't get lost in the forest!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a chilling adventure through a mysterious forest on a cold Christmas Eve night, searching for ornaments to decorate a Christmas tree. But beware\u2014something lurks in the\u00a0 snowy darkness\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics, viewed through the lens of a retro home video camera, create an immersive and chilling experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short, Christmas-themed horror game I created for the holiday season. I hope you find it both festive and fun! It\u2019s built using the same framework as my other game, <i>Backrooms: The Project</i>. This will help speed up development for that title and help me optimize it for the Steam Deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun, and don't get lost in the forest!</p>",
